{"availability":"available","full":"GeiserX/whisper-subs","name":"whisper-subs","description":"Jellyfin plugin for local AI-powered subtitle generation using Whisper - all processing stays on your server","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"C#","stars":108,"forks":9,"created":"2025-12-05T21:24:26Z","updated":"2026-10-08T11:40:38Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://geiserx.github.io/whisper-subs/","topics":["accessibility","ai","ai-subtitles","auto-subtitles","automation","crispasr","homelab","jellyfin","jellyfin-plugin","media-management","media-server","parakeet","self-hosted","speech-to-text","subtitle-generator","subtitle-translation","subtitles","transcription","whisper","whisper-cpp"],"demo":"https://geiserx.github.io/whisper-subs/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:22.862Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:22.862Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:22.862Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:54:12.428Z","stars":106,"forks":9},{"at":"2026-10-09T03:37:22.862Z","stars":108,"forks":9}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["WhisperSubs is a Jellyfin plugin that writes subtitles for the titles in your library that have none, by transcribing their audio with local AI models. Download providers such as OpenSubtitles only serve what someone has uploaded, and Bazarr's Whisper path needs a second service running beside it; WhisperSubs runs inside Jellyfin and makes the subtitle from the audio, in the audio's own language, and can translate it into English or, from English audio, into 24 more languages. Transcription runs on hardware you control: this Jellyfin server by default, plus any workers you add, and your media…"],"features":["A title with no subtitles gets one in the language of its audio, saved next to the file as Movie.es.WhisperSubs.srt, and the title is refreshed at once so the player offers the track right away.","A film in a language you do not speak gets an English subtitle too; English audio can also get subtitles in 24 European languages (Canary, experimental).","A film with a few lines of foreign dialogue gets a forced subtitle that covers only those lines.","A title you ask for jumps ahead of the nightly sweep. Your users can ask too, and a request costs no CPU until you approve it.","Generate Subtitles and Translate into... sit on every item page; a live banner on the settings page shows the current title, the phase and the queue."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GeiserX/whisper-subs/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d81f5cd8f2bd021b9ab0d58f95db70ce51f03ea3d09dbeb73b7a0de3b53ba518","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:12.811Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:22.985Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"WhisperSubs is a Jellyfin plugin that writes subtitles for the titles in your library that have none, by transcribing their audio with local AI models. Download providers such as OpenSubtitles only serve what someone has uploaded, and Bazarr's Whisper path needs a second service running beside it; WhisperSubs runs inside Jellyfin and makes the subtitle from the audio, in the audio's own language, and can translate it into English or, from English audio, into 24 more languages. Transcription runs on hardware you control: this Jellyfin server by default, plus any workers you add, and your media…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GeiserX/whisper-subs/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"d81f5cd8f2bd021b9ab0d58f95db70ce51f03ea3d09dbeb73b7a0de3b53ba518","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GeiserX/whisper-subs/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:22.985Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T11:40:38Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GeiserX/whisper-subs/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:22.985Z","hash":"d81f5cd8f2bd021b9ab0d58f95db70ce51f03ea3d09dbeb73b7a0de3b53ba518","originalBytes":6271,"stored